5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to begin this selection process with you all. To ensure our reporting remains transparent and manageable, I would like to look into independent checks on holdings' reported figures and appraisal needs at the last audit.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I agree that we need a logical basis for our decision. I will look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off to understand our actual return drivers.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must be mindful of our long-term financial commitments. I will look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to get started! I want to make sure we can actually support these teams, so I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings. I want to understand what typically delays the transition from investment to actual operation.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By covering everything from operational delays to financial reserves, we are leaving very little to chance. Does anyone feel we have missed a critical angle?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I believe we have covered the essential bases. By analyzing both the internal fund mechanics and the external performance of our holdings, we can make a decision based on evidence rather than intuition.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. We have a balanced approach that addresses both the immediate operational risks and the long-term sustainability of the fund. I am satisfied with this distribution of research.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,Everything looks great to me! I think we're covering all the bases. I can't wait to see what we find out so we can pick the best company together!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
