61,3,1,talk,Minako,,"Ledger Bridge is the most sustainable option. It avoids the equipment costs that drain our reserves and the staffing risks Mio mentioned. Despite the security review, it protects our liquidity best.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
