64,3,2,talk,Servas,,It is rare to see such immediate and unanimous alignment. Ledger Bridge offers the stability and profile we need to move forward with confidence. I also vote for Ledger Bridge.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
